文字・小文字を区別する。\n                検索パターンについては|match()|を使う。\n                {haystack}の中に{needle}がないときは-1を返す。\n                |strridx()|も参照。\n                例:  \n                  :echo stridx(\"An Example\", \"Example\")      3\n                  :echo stridx(\"Starting point\", \"Start\")    0\n                  :echo stridx(\"Starting point\", \"start\")   -1\n```","ts":"1630731074.005200","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"8440bf8d-4cbe-4bd0-aee1-4a77d6ad1c4e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h stridx()","ts":"1630731074.005000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hSKq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b22e209-8c1c-49e1-b0ff-c8433958c871","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"文字列内に hoge が含まれている行みたいな","ts":"1630731051.004600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p/KM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63b4d964-e00d-4a9e-8626-5c9fd6f50972","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"これって、例えば js でいう `includes()`みたいな感じはすべて正規表現マッチでやる感じなんですかね？","ts":"1630731027.004200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7ZG"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n1\n```","ts":"1630730998.003500","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"77071835-bb23-467d-9cb6-60e8a258c267","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":echo \"hoge\" !~# \"ag\"","ts":"1630730998.003400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZhT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"840e6cc1-bd90-4f5c-a70d-bf20eb27b085","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"実行もできて便利","ts":"1630730982.003000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01AQ